{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_037_biovil-title\">BioViL</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以放射报告专用 CXR-BERT 提升文本语义，再联合学习检查级图文对比与短语–视觉 patch grounding。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Pairs a radiology-specialized text encoder (CXR-BERT with RSM masked pretraining) with joint global and local patch–phrase contrastive alignment.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">胸部 X-ray 与对应放射报告/短语</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Chest radiograph + radiology report findings/impression text</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">具备报告语义与局部 grounding 能力的胸片表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Negation- and clinical-syntax-aware visual-linguistic embeddings and local phrase grounding maps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.ecva.net/papers/eccv_2022/papers_ECCV/html/1557_ECCV_2022_paper.php\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_037_biovil')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_037_biovil')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BioViL original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6b3ce9de00b0c0e6b3b1.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_037_biovil\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_037_biovil')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_037_biovil\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">胸部 X-ray</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Chest X-Ray</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">单幅胸片进入保留空间特征的视觉 encoder。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests chest radiograph + radiology report findings/impression text and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest X-Ray).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"单幅胸片进入保留空间特征的视觉 encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests chest radiograph + radiology report findings/impression text and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest X-Ray).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"胸部 X-ray\" data-node-name-en=\"Chest X-Ray\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">胸部 X-ray</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Chest X-Ray</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单幅胸片进入保留空间特征的视觉 encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests chest radiograph + radiology report findings/impression text and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest X-Ray).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积主干同时产生全局检查向量和局部 patch/region 表征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes CXR Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"CXR Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CXR Image Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CXR Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积主干同时产生全局检查向量和局部 patch/region 表征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes CXR Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局与局部视觉特征映射到共享图文维度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Visual Projection within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"视觉投影\" data-node-name-en=\"Visual Projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Visual Projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局与局部视觉特征映射到共享图文维度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Visual Projection within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"放射报告既提供完整句义，也提供可定位的短语查询。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"报告 / 短语\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">报告 / 短语</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">放射报告既提供完整句义，也提供可定位的短语查询。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"先在放射报告上领域预训练的语言 encoder 表达否定与专业术语。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CXR-BERT within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"CXR-BERT\" data-node-name-en=\"CXR-BERT\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CXR-BERT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">先在放射报告上领域预训练的语言 encoder 表达否定与专业术语。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CXR-BERT within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"句级和 token/短语级语言特征映射到共享空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"文本投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">句级和 token/短语级语言特征映射到共享空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"检查级图像与对应报告在 batch 内双向对齐。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Global Image–Text Alignment within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"全局图文对比\" data-node-name-en=\"Global Image–Text Alignment\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局图文对比</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Global Image–Text Alignment</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">检查级图像与对应报告在 batch 内双向对齐。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Global Image–Text Alignment within the core radiology specialized global local vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"短语向量与视觉网格计算相似图，强化局部语义。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies –Patch to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"短语–Patch 对齐\" data-node-name-en=\"–Patch\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">短语–Patch 对齐</span><span class=\"lang-en\">–Patch</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">短语向量与视觉网格计算相似图，强化局部语义。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies –Patch to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"支持零/少样本分类、图文检索和短语 grounding。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces negation- and clinical-syntax-aware visual-linguistic embeddings and local phrase grounding maps via BioViL representation.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"BioViL 表征\" data-node-name-en=\"BioViL representation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_037_biovil', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">BioViL 表征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">BioViL representation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">支持零/少样本分类、图文检索和短语 grounding。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces negation- and clinical-syntax-aware visual-linguistic embeddings and local phrase grounding maps via BioViL representation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BioViL Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · BioViL 用放射短语查询局部视觉 patch</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Radiology-Specific CXR-BERT Semantic Encoding + Local Patch–Phrase Alignment</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BioViL：核心公式 · BioViL 用放射短语查询局部视觉 patch\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"37\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"29.776259pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.770213 -69.00913 192.314746 29.776259\" width=\"192.314746pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.597937 0V-.158807C5.032188-.208434 4.96271-.287837 4.843605-1.012393L3.910615-6.63018H3.652554L.774183-1.667471C-.009925-.34739-.10918-.23821-.506196-.158807V0H1.349857V-.158807C.843661-.208434 .764257-.258061 .764257-.506196C.764257-.694779 .794034-.784108 .962766-1.121572L1.528515-2.243145H3.712107L3.910615-.942915C3.920541-.853586 3.930466-.764257 3.930466-.684854C3.930466-.307688 3.79151-.218359 3.156283-.158807V0H5.597937ZM3.66248-2.60046H1.736948L3.225761-5.181069L3.66248-2.60046Z\" id=\"m037_g16-22\"></path><path d=\"M2.342399 0V-.158807C1.77665-.228285 1.667471-.287837 1.667471-.565749C1.667471-.764257 1.687321-.863512 1.77665-1.19105L2.997477-5.588011C3.176134-6.163686 3.235687-6.223238 3.811361-6.322492V-6.481299H1.359783V-6.322492C1.935457-6.253014 2.054562-6.183537 2.054562-5.895699C2.054562-5.746818 2.024786-5.54831 1.945382-5.280323L.724556-.893288C.545898-.317613 .47642-.258061-.079403-.158807V0H2.342399Z\" id=\"m037_g16-30\"></path><path d=\"M3.831212 .595525C3.821287-.029776 3.344866-.466495 2.392026-.71463C1.955308-.82381 1.697247-.982617 1.697247-1.131498S1.925531-1.53844 2.054562-1.53844C2.054562-1.53844 2.094264-1.53844 2.12404-1.528515C2.203443-1.508664 2.342399-1.498738 2.431728-1.498738C3.334941-1.498738 4.24808-2.292772 4.24808-3.066955C4.24808-3.235687 4.218303-3.42427 4.158751-3.632704H4.655022L4.645096-4.019795H4.039646C4.00987-4.019795 3.960242-4.039646 3.880839-4.099198C3.612853-4.277856 3.285314-4.37711 2.908148-4.37711C1.806426-4.37711 .923064-3.61285